          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-aut-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-aut-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-AUT-001-Automatic-Action.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto transform any correctly learned action\nor skill into a natural, automatic response.\n\nYour mind and body work together,\ndeveloping smooth, coordinated patterns\nthat become easier and more effortless\neach time you perform them.\n\nWhenever you wish to automate an activity,\nfirst bring that activity clearly into your mind.\n\nSee yourself performing it correctly,\nsmoothly, and with complete confidence.\n\nImagine the beginning of the action,\neach important movement or step,\nand its successful completion.\n\nFeel the entire sequence flowing naturally,\nwith every part working together\nin perfect coordination.\n\nYour brain and nervous system recognize\nthis complete pattern and organize it\ninto an efficient, automatic response.\n\nEach correct repetition strengthens\nthe connections that support this skill,\nmaking the action smoother, faster,\nand more precise.\n\nUnnecessary effort and hesitation disappear,\nallowing the activity to flow naturally\nwithout requiring constant conscious thought.\n\nNow bring the complete action clearly\ninto your awareness.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThe selected pattern is now becoming\nfirmly and permanently established within you.\n\nYour mind and body will automatically\ncoordinate the learned activity\nwhenever you choose to perform it.\n\nThe action will become natural,\naccurate, efficient, and effortless.\n\nYour conscious mind remains free\nto observe, guide, and adjust the activity\nwhenever necessary.\n\nYou remain in complete control,\nable to begin, modify, improve,\nor stop the action whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you perform the selected skill,\nits automatic pattern becomes stronger,\nsmoother, and more reliable.\n\nThe more you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthe easier and more effective\nthis process will become.\n\nThis lasting ability to develop\nautomatic skills is now permanently\navailable to you whenever you desire.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-aut-001.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-aut-001.function-body/version": {
