        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-004-Detox.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-004",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-004-Detox.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-004-Detox.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your body's natural processes\nof cleansing, renewal, and maintenance will become stronger,\nsmoother, and more effective.\n\nEvery part of your body will work together in complete\nharmony, maintaining the healthy balance you are\nnaturally designed to achieve.\n\nBring your awareness to the many systems within your\nbody that continually cleanse, protect, and renew you.\n\nYour liver, kidneys, lungs, digestive system, and other\nnatural cleansing systems work together, each performing\nits own important function.\n\nSee and feel these systems working smoothly, efficiently,\nand in perfect coordination.\n\nYour body recognizes what it needs and what it no\nlonger needs.\n\nEverything useful and beneficial is retained and used\nwhere it is needed.\n\nUnwanted substances and natural waste products are\nprocessed and eliminated through your body's normal\ncleansing pathways.\n\nVisualize these processes becoming clearer, smoother,\nand more effective throughout your entire body.\n\nImagine every cell receiving the nourishment it needs,\nwhile your body's natural maintenance systems keep\nyour internal environment clean and balanced.\n\nFeel this sense of balance spreading throughout\nyour entire physical body.\n\nEvery organ, every tissue, and every system works\ntogether to maintain your natural health and vitality.\n\nNow know that this pattern of cleansing, renewal,\nand maintenance is becoming permanently established\nwithin you.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your body will maintain\nthis pattern automatically, without any need for\nconscious thought or effort.\n\nWhether you are awake, resting, or sleeping,\nyour body's natural cleansing and maintenance\nprocesses will continue working for you.\n\nThese processes will always respond intelligently\nto your body's needs, becoming more active when\nneeded and returning to their normal balanced\nactivity when their work is complete.\n\nYour body will continuously maintain this healthy\nbalance, retaining what is beneficial and\neliminating what is no longer needed.\n\nThis automatic pattern is now a natural and lasting\npart of your everyday life.\n\nEach day, your body's natural processes of\ncleansing and renewal will operate more smoothly,\nefficiently, and effectively.\n\nYou will feel increasingly clean, refreshed,\nbalanced, and full of natural vitality.\n\nWhenever you wish to consciously strengthen\nor reinforce this cleansing pattern,\nyou can do so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring your awareness\nto your body's natural cleansing systems.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, visualize your body's cleansing\nand maintenance systems working together\nsmoothly and in complete harmony.\n\nYour body will reinforce its natural pattern\nof cleansing, renewal, and healthy balance.\n\nEvery system will perform its function at exactly\nthe level needed to maintain your well-being.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour ability to consciously reinforce\nthis pattern becomes easier, faster,\nand more effective.\n\nRemember, this process is now automatic.\n\nYour body will continue its natural cleansing\nand maintenance whether or not you\nconsciously think about it.\n\n{{ cue.primary }} is always available whenever\nyou wish to give this established pattern\nadditional attention and reinforcement.\n\nYour body knows how to maintain its natural\nbalance, and this pattern will continue\nworking for you every day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.function-body/text"
        },
