        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, your heart's natural processes\nof maintenance and renewal are now firmly\nestablished as a lasting, automatic pattern.\n\nWhenever you wish to consciously reinforce\nthis pattern, simply close your eyes.\n\nBring your attention to your heart.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Heart Flow exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "1.3.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-006",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, the muscles, nerves,\nand blood vessels within and around your heart\nare becoming stronger, healthier, and more balanced.\n\nBring your awareness to your heart,\nworking steadily and naturally within your chest.\n\nFeel its strength and its steady rhythm.\n\nWith every heartbeat, your heart performs\nits important work, circulating blood\nthroughout your entire physical body.\n\nNow become aware of the muscles of your heart.\n\nSee and feel these muscles becoming stronger,\nhealthier, and more efficient.\n\nEvery part of your heart works together\nin perfect coordination, providing exactly\nthe strength needed for smooth, steady circulation.\n\nYour heart muscles are strong and balanced,\nworking naturally and efficiently\nwithout unnecessary strain.\n\nNow bring your awareness to the blood vessels\nwithin and around your heart.\n\nVisualize each artery and vein becoming stronger,\nhealthier, and more flexible.\n\nSee the pathways of circulation becoming\nsmooth and clear, allowing blood\nto flow freely and evenly.\n\nYour heart receives the oxygen and nourishment\nit needs to maintain its strength and vitality.\n\nImagine every part of your heart receiving\na steady, balanced supply of blood.\n\nSee its entire circulation system\nworking smoothly and efficiently.\n\nNow bring your awareness to the signals\nthat guide and coordinate your heartbeat.\n\nThese signals are clear, steady,\nand perfectly coordinated.\n\nEvery signal reaches its intended destination,\nguiding your heart muscles to work together\nin a smooth and balanced rhythm.\n\nYour heart responds naturally and appropriately\nto the changing needs of your body.\n\nWhen you are resting, your heart works\ncalmly and efficiently.\n\nWhen you are active, your heart adjusts\nits activity smoothly and naturally\nto provide the circulation your body needs.\n\nEvery part of your heart works together\nin complete harmony.\n\nNow become aware of your heart's natural\nprocesses of maintenance and renewal.\n\nVisualize every muscle, vessel, and supporting\nstructure receiving the nourishment\nand care it needs.\n\nSee your body's natural maintenance systems\nworking together, supporting the strength,\nbalance, and healthy function of your heart.\n\nYour heart is growing stronger,\nsteadier, and more efficient.\n\nIts muscles work in harmony,\nits circulation flows smoothly,\nand its rhythm remains naturally balanced.\n\nNow know that this pattern of healthy\nheart maintenance and renewal\nis becoming permanently established within you.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your body's natural\nprocesses of heart maintenance will continue\nautomatically, without conscious thought or effort.\n\nWhether you are awake, resting, or sleeping,\nthese processes will continue working for you.\n\nYour heart will maintain its natural strength,\ncoordination, and healthy balance.\n\nThese processes will always respond intelligently\nto the needs of your body, providing exactly\nthe level of activity and support required.\n\nWhen more circulation is needed,\nyour heart will respond appropriately.\n\nWhen your body is resting,\nyour heart will return to its natural,\ncomfortable, and efficient rhythm.\n\nThis automatic pattern of healthy maintenance\nis now a lasting part of your everyday life.\n\nEach day, your heart's natural processes\nof maintenance and renewal will work\nmore smoothly, efficiently, and effectively.\n\nFeel the confidence of knowing that\nyour heart is supported by these\nautomatic processes of healthy maintenance.\n\nYour heart is strong, steady,\nbalanced, and full of natural vitality.\n\nWhenever you wish to consciously strengthen\nor reinforce this established pattern,\nyou can do so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring\nyour awareness to your heart.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say\nto yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, visualize your heart\nworking smoothly, strongly,\nand in perfect coordination.\n\nFeel its natural rhythm,\nits steady strength,\nand its balanced activity.\n\nYour mind reinforces this established pattern\nof healthy heart maintenance and renewal.\n\nEvery muscle, vessel, and supporting system\nworks together in complete harmony.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour ability to consciously reinforce\nthis pattern becomes easier, faster,\nand more effective.\n\nRemember, this process is now automatic.\n\nYour body's natural processes of heart maintenance\nwill continue working whether or not\nyou consciously think about them.\n\n{{ cue.primary }} is always available\nwhenever you wish to give this established\npattern additional attention and reinforcement.\n\nYour heart will continue maintaining\nits natural strength, balance,\nand efficient function every day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/text"
        },
