        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-010-Nutricia.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to direct how your body\nuses food energy, close your eyes, inhale deeply,\nand hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}\"\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }},\" according to your desire.\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Nutricia exercise.",
