          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-013-Body-Tune-Up.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to perceive,\nbalance, or heal any part of your physical body,\nclose your eyes and focus on that area.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Body Tune-Up exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.closer/text"
