        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to access\nyour personal library of knowledge,\nthink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen focus on the information you desire,\nand allow it to enter your conscious awareness.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Information Access exercise.",
