          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-004.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-004.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-004-Imprint.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to capture,\nstore, and remember information and experiences\nis becoming stronger, clearer, and more accurate.\n\nWhenever you wish to preserve something in memory,\nbring your complete attention to the information\nor experience you desire to remember.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nFocus clearly on what you wish to remember,\nthen exhale slowly and easily.\n\nYour senses will become more attentive\nto every important detail of your experience.\n\nImages, sounds, words, feelings, and sensations\nwill be perceived clearly and precisely.\n\nYour mind will organize this information,\nconnecting it with your existing knowledge\nand placing it securely into long-term memory.\n\nEvery important detail will be preserved,\nclear, complete, and accurate.\n\nThe information you have chosen to imprint\nwill remain firmly established within you,\navailable whenever you desire to remember it.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your mind will\nautomatically strengthen and maintain\nthe memories you have consciously imprinted.\n\nWhether awake, resting, or sleeping,\nyour natural processes of memory consolidation\nwill continue organizing and reinforcing\nthe information you have chosen to preserve.\n\nWhenever you wish to remember an imprinted\nexperience or any part of its details,\nsimply think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-COG-004-RECALL }}.\"\n\nThe information will return immediately\ninto your conscious awareness,\nclear, vivid, and complete.\n\nYou will remember the knowledge,\nsensations, and details you have stored\nwith confidence and accuracy.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto consciously imprint information\nis permanently available to you.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour ability to capture and retain\ninformation becomes easier, faster,\nand more effective.\n\nYour selected memories will remain\nclear and accessible, ready to return\nto your awareness whenever you desire.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-004.function-body/text"
        },
