          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-007-Think-Fast.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-007-Think-Fast.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your entire mental process\nis becoming faster, clearer, and more capable.\n\nYour mind and brain work together\nwith increasing speed, accuracy,\nand effortless coordination.\n\nYou observe and understand information quickly,\nrecognizing important details\nand their meaning with greater clarity.\n\nYour thoughts become organized and precise,\nallowing you to recognize patterns,\nconnect ideas, and understand\neven complex situations more easily.\n\nYou hold relevant information clearly\nin your awareness, bringing ideas together\nto form complete understanding.\n\nWhenever you encounter a problem,\nyour mind will rapidly examine the information,\nrecognize possible solutions,\nand identify the correct answer.\n\nNew ideas and understanding will emerge\nnaturally and quickly into your awareness.\n\nYou will adapt easily to new information,\nseeing situations from different perspectives\nand recognizing the best way forward.\n\nEven when time is limited,\nyour mind will remain calm, confident,\nfocused, and fully alert.\n\nYou will think quickly without rushing,\nresponding with clarity, precision,\nand sound judgment.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this growing\nmental ability is permanently\nestablished within you.\n\nYour mental processing will continue\nbecoming faster, clearer, and more efficient,\nnaturally improving with every experience.\n\nWhenever you wish to intensify\nyour mental clarity and thinking speed,\ninhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nYour mind will immediately become\nclear, alert, focused, and responsive.\n\nYou will understand information rapidly,\nrecognize the connections that matter,\nand find solutions with increasing ease.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour thinking becomes faster,\nsmoother, and more effective.\n\nYour ability to think clearly,\ncompletely, calmly, and rapidly\nwill continue strengthening automatically,\nevery day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-007-Think-Fast.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.0",
