          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to strengthen or restore {{ function.title }},\ninhale easily, think or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }},\"\nand exhale naturally.\n\nWith the same breath, use \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-OBSERVE }}\"\nto allow intentional contact,\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-SUSPEND }}\" to pause the entire function.\n\nThis concludes your OCF exercise.",
