        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, {{ function.title }} is permanently\nestablished within your total self,\noperating automatically whenever needed.\n\nBecome aware of your body and the space around it.\nPicture, feel, or simply know this space as calm and clear.\n\nWhen unwanted insects or similar small pests approach\nor make contact, your total self carries one steady intention:\nremain away, move away, and continue peacefully elsewhere.\nThis intention extends around your whole body,\nwelcoming undisturbed space without harm to other life.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious awareness, physical being,\nand higher self work together around this purpose.\nYour calm attention and natural actions cooperate with it,\nwithout constant effort or repeated checking.\n\nWhenever you wish to strengthen this pattern\nor restore its automatic operation, inhale easily.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen let your breath flow out naturally.\nYour total self renews this intention as one.\n\nFor deliberate observation or interaction with insects,\nuse the same breath and think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-OBSERVE }}.\"\nThe outward encouragement pauses,\nwhile your calm awareness remains active.\n\nTo pause the entire function, use the same breath\nand think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-SUSPEND }}.\"\nAll activity of this function pauses.\nYour ordinary awareness and natural responses remain intact.\n\nEach chosen mode replaces the previous one.\nBoth overrides are temporary.\nWhen you next enter normal sleep or become unconscious,\neither override ends and automatic operation resumes.\nDeliberately using the primary command restores it sooner.\n\nYour learned ability remains with you in every mode.\nThe more you use this function,\nthe more naturally your attention, intention,\nand total self work together.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/text"
        },
