        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-006-Intuition.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your intuitive awareness develops\nas a calm and beneficial part of your everyday life.\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical being,\nand higher self cooperate in deeper understanding.\n\nCenter your attention in your heart.\nWelcome an attitude of kindness, openness, and discernment.\nYou may recognize guidance as a feeling, an image,\na quiet understanding, or a connection that becomes clear over time.\nYour own way of experiencing awareness is welcome.\n\nWhenever you wish to understand something more deeply,\nbring one question or situation into your awareness.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nAllow a quiet moment to notice what arises,\nthen consider what it means and choose your response.\n\nYour total self works together around your intention.\nThe wisdom of your heart, subconscious mind, and higher self\nbecomes available to your conscious understanding.\nRemain open to the wider consciousness you recognize,\ngrounded in your present experience and free to discern.\n\nAn impression is an invitation to explore.\nYou can welcome it, reflect upon it, or let it pass.\nCompare what you sense with what you can observe and learn.\nGive important decisions the time, evidence, and care they deserve.\nClear understanding includes recognizing when you do not yet know.\n\nYour intuition supports constructive, purposeful action.\nChoose responses that respect your well-being\nand the freedom and well-being of others.\nWhen greater clarity is needed, allow understanding to develop\nthrough reflection, experience, and thoughtful conversation.\n\nThis beneficial development continues without constant effort.\nYour attention remains available for the life before you.\nIntuitive impressions can come gently and leave freely;\nyou decide which deserve your attention and how to respond.\n\nThe more you practice with openness and discernment,\nthe more naturally your total self contributes\nto clear understanding and purposeful action.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/text"
        },
