        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-003-Quick-Recharge.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to restore yourself\nthrough a short period of natural sleep,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Quick Recharge exercise.",
