          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto relax your entire body and mind deeply,\nnaturally, and whenever you desire.\n\nYour body knows how to release unnecessary\neffort, strain, and tension, returning\nto a comfortable state of balance.\n\nWhenever you wish to relax, inhale deeply\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nWith this breath, all unnecessary tension\nand stress will flow out of your body,\nleaving you comfortably relaxed.\n\nYour muscles will soften and release,\nfrom your face and shoulders to your hands,\nback, legs, and feet.\n\nYour breathing will become smooth and easy.\nYour nervous system will settle into\na calm, balanced rhythm throughout your body.\n\nYour thoughts will become quiet and clear.\nYour mind will remain serene and at ease,\nfree of unnecessary effort or distraction.\n\nYou can enter this peaceful state while resting\nor remain comfortably alert when you need\nto think, move, or act.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your ability\nto release tension is permanently available,\nand your body will return to balance\nmore naturally with each experience.\n\nWhenever you use {{ cue.primary }},\nrelaxation will flow through your total self,\ndeeper and more easily than before.\n\nEach time you use this function,\nbecoming calm, comfortable, and relaxed\nwill be easier, faster, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-004.function-body/text"
        },
