        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-004-Light-Foot.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your body will learn\na lighter, quieter, and more efficient way of moving.\n\nWhether walking through daily life, climbing steps,\njogging, or running, your feet and legs will work\ntogether with natural ease and precision.\n\nYour feet will lift cleanly from the ground,\nmoving forward without dragging or scraping.\nEach foot will return gently and deliberately,\nwith just the pressure needed for stable support.\n\nYour steps will grow quieter, smoother, and lighter.\nUnnecessary impact, tension, and wasted motion\nwill fade from the way you move.\n\nYour posture, balance, and rhythm will adjust together.\nYou will place each foot where you intend,\nadapting naturally to the ground beneath you\nand the movement you have chosen.\n\nYour total self will learn this pattern so thoroughly\nthat it becomes your natural way of walking,\nwithout needing to think about each separate step.\n\nThis improvement will remain part of your everyday\nmovement, even when you are not consciously\nusing the Light Foot command.\n\nWhenever you wish to strengthen this lightness\nand efficiency even further, inhale deeply\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nYour movement will immediately become lighter,\nquieter, more balanced, and more economical,\nwhile maintaining the awareness and control\nappropriate to your surroundings.\n\nEach time you move, your body will reinforce\nthis effortless pattern. Each time you use\n{{ cue.primary }}, it will become easier\nand more effective to express at will.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-004-Light-Foot.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/version"
