        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-001.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-001-Hearing.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to regulate your hearing or strengthen\nyour inner experience of sound, close your eyes,\ninhale deeply, and hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}\"\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-SEN-001-HEAR-LESS }},\" according to your intention.\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Hearing exercise.",
