        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-003-Smell.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto regulate your sense of smell and develop\nthe richness of your inner scent awareness.\n\nYour sense of smell will become more responsive\nto your conscious intention. You can notice\ndelicate aromas more clearly or allow unwanted\nodors to fade into the background.\n\nTo increase your perception of smell, close your eyes,\ninhale deeply, and gently hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nFaint scents will become clearer and more distinct.\nYou will recognize subtle differences between aromas\nand appreciate their character and richness.\n\nTo reduce the prominence of an unwanted odor,\nuse the same eye and breathing sequence,\nthinking or saying, \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-SEN-003-SMELL-LESS }}.\"\nIts presence in your awareness will grow quieter,\nwhile you remain free to change your adjustment\nor return to your usual sense of smell.\n\nYour inner sense of smell will also grow stronger.\nYou will recall familiar fragrances and imagine\nnew ones, even when no physical aroma is present.\nYou can bring a remembered scent into awareness,\nhold it clearly, distinguish its subtle qualities,\nand combine or transform aromas through imagination.\n\nYour mind will connect scents with memories,\nplaces, experiences, and images more vividly.\nThis ability to imagine and remember aromas\nwill become a lasting part of your total self.\n\nWhenever you choose, your intention and these\ncommands can help make an inner aroma more vivid\nor let an imagined scent gently fade.\n\nWith each use, your physical smell regulation\nand inner scent imagery will become easier,\nclearer, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-003.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-003-Smell.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-003.function-body/version"
        },
