          "value": "From this moment forward, whenever you prepare for sleep,\nyou can direct your total self toward deep healing,\nrestoration, and regeneration throughout your rest.\n\nBring into awareness any part of your physical body\nor total being that you desire to restore.\nForm a clear intention for complete balance,\nrenewal, and natural, healthy functioning.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nYou will move easily and calmly into deep,\npeaceful, natural sleep.\n\nAs you sleep, your conscious mind can rest\nwhile your subconscious mind and higher self\nwork together with your physical body,\ndirecting their resources toward restoration.\n\nYour entire system will adjust, equalize,\nand return toward its natural balance.\nAreas of weariness, strain, or imbalance\nwill receive the attention needed for renewal.\n\nYour total self will continue this restorative pattern\nsmoothly and automatically throughout your sleep,\nsupporting the healing, repair, and regeneration\nyou have clearly intended.\n\nEach part of your being will cooperate with the others,\nrestoring harmony and strengthening natural vitality.\nThere is no need to follow or direct each step.\nThe process continues while you rest.\n\nAs your sleep is complete, you will awaken\nnaturally, deeply rested and refreshed,\nwith renewed energy, clarity, and strength.\n\nYour ability to invoke this restorative sleep pattern\nwill remain permanently available whenever you choose.\nEach use will make entering restful sleep\nand directing your total self toward healing\neasier, smoother, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-001.function-body/text"
        },
