          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-002-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to enter normal,\nnatural, restful sleep, breathe slowly and deeply.\nAs you exhale, think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThis concludes your OCF Sleep exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-002.closer/text"
