          "value": "This OCF exercise will teach you to choose the dreams\nyou wish to experience, allowing your total self\nto create them during sleep and helping you remember\nthem clearly and joyfully when you awaken.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.opener/text"
        },
